# Where this deploys to, and the path its downloads are served under.
#
# Not secrets in the cryptographic sense, but the download path is the only
# thing between a stranger and the installer, and the installer carries the
# connector secret once it is generated. scripts/deploy.env.example is the
# tracked template; the filled-in copy never leaves the machine.
scripts/deploy.env

# Anything pulled off a live machine while debugging. These have held real
# device tokens and company data.
*.local.json
/relay/relay.db*
/tmp-*/

# Real data exported from the customer's Tally during Phase 0, and connector
# logs. Kept on disk because the findings were drawn from them and they are
# worth re-reading, but never committed: they hold a live product catalogue,
# real customers and real amounts. This repository is public.
phase0-direct/
*.log
